config BR2_PACKAGE_TRACEMARK
	bool "tracemark"
	help
	  `tracemark on|off` executes a trace marker instruction, to
	  start or stop QEMU (tracewin plugin) and Spike
	  (SPIKE_TRACE_GATE) tracing. Also installs <trace_marker.h>
	  with TRACE_ON()/TRACE_OFF() for other packages.

	  See docs/tracing.md in the custom_rv32 external tree.
